==German==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˌyːbərˈtraːɡən/|[ˌʔyːbɐˈtʁaːɡŋ̍]|[-ɡən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-übertragen.ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|de|über|tra|gen}}

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|de|id=to transfer|calque|la>trānsferō>to transfer}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|übertragen}}, at least in part a {{cal|de|la|transfero|transferre|nocap=1}}. Analysable as {{prefix|de|über|t1=over|tragen|t2=to carry}}. Compare {{cog|nl|overdragen}}, {{m+|en|carry over}}.

====Verb====
{{de-verb|übertragen<überträgt#übertrug,übertragen,übertrüge>}}

# to [[transfer]], [[transmit]]
# to [[translate]]
# to [[broadcast]], [[televise]]
# to [[hand over]] something to someone, [[entrust]] someone with something, [[confer]] a right on someone
# {{lb|de|medicine}} to have a post-term [[birth]]
# {{lb|de|reflexive}} to be passed on to someone {{q|of a disease or illness}}
# {{lb|de|reflexive|figuratively}} to communicate itself to someone {{q|of enthusiasm, nervousness, etc.}}

